; HYPOTHETICAL -- NOT L0. Does not check. Assumes the facilities listed in
; README.md in this directory: read_line, write_stdout, and the argv form of
; main.
;
; The prompt program. The question is written, and flushed because a read
; follows, before the answer is read; the greeting depends on the answer.
; Unblocks limit 04.

(def main ((args (list (list int)))) int
  (let asked (write_stdout "What is your name? ")
    (let name (take_line (read_line))
      (let greeted (write_stdout (append "Hello, " (append name "!\n")))
        0))))
